  "content": "<p>Polar的探索扩展是一个模组，它添加了使《我的世界》世界更具探索趣味的特性，同时提供了有趣的挑战和迷人的景观。该模组还包含了一些Vanilla Plus的特性，例如用于建造的额外<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fa8e9f447636a7a9a86bf661e821d51bf93f0e66c.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">石头</a>和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252f6e430d6ee92ac711ee74f5c8863ff8b59e52c74b.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">木材</a>方块、修改后的战利品表，以及额外的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fbd4db70fe80aa2a6cfbb2d7db5b02bbee1aa9d68.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">药水变体</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2a405f692d05ae040f51941eddcd0ff374b2c613.png\" alt=\"新的石头变体\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc14641367dd982a8d3ff4d8ebe54ee9567dc7fd_0.webp\" alt=\"新的木材变体\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7fc85f7bf7e2152c3c76c236c3e3980aeb37a5f3.png\" alt=\"战利品表\"></p>\n<p>其他主要更改包括8个<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252f869040c2b2d3489a95f5a15fec9c429aa0c4eb58_0.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\">新生物群系</a>、27个<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fe9d7332a490b1e70d3c25fbc189af6eccdb415db.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">新结构</a>、10个<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fa0ab08523909030338dce21b05904d054dfecb7b.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">新生物</a>、一个Boss、一个<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fc34b84c067732548bea5ae6a4d105e6c8aa8d4ab.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">重做的末地维度</a>、独特的武器，以及大量填补原版空白的建筑方块和物品。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1Lqmo11r5uE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
